<article class="ltx_document">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Three Concrete Challenges and Two Hopes for the Safety of Unsupervised Elicitation</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Callum Canavan
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
